straints of the type are tighter than can be conveyed. For example, a PQ that is for a true measured amount whose units are not supported in UCUM, a need to convey a REAL when the type has been constrained to INT, etc.<br/><br/>With coded datatypes, this null flavor may only be used if the vocabulary binding has a coding strength of CNE. By definition, all local codes and original text are part of the value set if the coding strength is CWE.</td><td>Anders</td><td>Other</td><td>Anders</td></tr></table></li><li>Include these codes as defined in <a href=\"http://www.snomed.org/\"><code>http://snomed.info/sct</code></a><span title=\"Version is not explicitly stated. No matching Code System found\"> version Not Stated (use latest from terminology server)</span><table class=\"none\"><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><b>Code</b></td><td><b>Display</b></td><td><b>Comments</b></td><td><b>Synonym</b></td><td><b>English (United States) (English (United States), en)</b></td><td><b>Nederlands (Nederland) (Dutch (Netherlands), nl)</b></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://snomed.info/id/219006\">219006</a></td><td>drinkt alcohol</td><td>Note: Drinkt alcohol </td><td>drinkt alcohol</td><td>Current drinker</td><td>drinkt alcohol</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://snomed.info/id/105542008\">105542008</a></td><td>drinkt momenteel geen alcohol</td><td>Note: Niet-drinker </td><td>drinkt momenteel geen alcohol</td><td>Non - drinker</td><td>drinkt momenteel geen alcohol</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://snomed.info/id/82581004\">82581004</a></td><td>dronk vroeger alcohol</td><td>Note: Dronk vroeger alcohol </td><td>dronk vroeger alcohol</td><td>Ex-drinker</td><td>dronk vroeger alcohol</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://snomed.info/id/228274009\">228274009</a></td><td>levenslang niet-drinker</td><td>Note: Levenslang niet drinker </td><td>levenslang niet-drinker</td><td>Lifetime non-drinker</td><td>levenslang niet-drinker</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://snomed.info/id/783261004\">783261004